@startuml

hide footbox
autonumber

title US001 - To register a user in the system

actor Administrator
participant ":System" as System

' Human contact between Administrator and UI
activate Administrator
    Administrator -> System : I want to register a user in the system

    activate System
    System -->> Administrator : Provide username, contact, profile and role for the new user
    Administrator -> System : Here's the username, contact, profile and role
    System -->> Administrator : New user has been registered in the system
    deactivate System

deactivate Administrator
@enduml